  "vote": "Phase 0c (DECISIONS 75): a lit OH-corrected 1545 nm trough (> 1.25 u) turns Unlikely into Borderline. Across 3,280 scans: 66 changes (19 flagged), none on true-zero archaeological bone, no reference bone with a yield >= 0.3% affected; 1.0 u would free true-zero bone, so the line stays at 1.25."
